      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S ODEN (2) missed the frame last time at Warragul but the start prior rocketed around 450m at Ballarat in 25.18. Looks the one to beat on win two back. SHE'S SAINTLY (1) comes off an average performance last start when seventh at this track over 520m behind Riorson Bale (30.47) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from eight attempts. Expected to run well. TERRA BELLA (8) stalked the lead from a low draw and fought on well to finish 3 lengths back in second (25.51) at Q Lakeside in a Restricted WIN over 457m. Can feature again. JIMMY LEGS (4) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
